('advanced-native-716', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-716-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It helped the speaker become mentally ready for the review."],"options":["It proved the feedback could not be useful.","It helped the speaker become mentally ready for the review.","It delayed the review while the speaker remained distracted.","It helped the speaker prepare a defensive reply instead of considering the feedback."]},"advanced-native-716-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It helps me get into the right frame of mind to listen.","I want to think about what I actually need to say.","A pause helps me avoid responding too sharply.","I can remind myself to ask questions rather than assume."],"options":["It helps me get into the right frame of mind to listen.","I want to think about what I actually need to say.","A pause helps me avoid responding too sharply.","I can remind myself to ask questions rather than assume."]},"advanced-native-716-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The routine helps her get into the right frame of mind for study."],"options":["She has postponed studying without becoming more mentally ready.","The routine helps her get into the right frame of mind for study.","She has only chosen the study materials and is still too distracted to begin."]},"advanced-native-716-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["It guarantees success without preparation or relevant skills."],"options":["The suitable state may depend on the activity.","It guarantees success without preparation or relevant skills.","A person feels mentally ready for the task at hand."]},"advanced-native-716-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Take a short pause to get into the right frame of mind, then check what the reply needs to achieve."],"options":["Once you feel ready, the facts in the reply cannot need checking.","Take a short pause to get into the right frame of mind, then check what the reply needs to achieve.","Feeling irritated means you should send the first response wi