('advanced-native-717', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-717-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It helped her feel emotionally prepared."],"options":["It meant every person at the meeting was an enemy.","It removed any need to listen to the discussion.","It helped her feel emotionally prepared.","It guaranteed that criticism could never affect her."]},"advanced-native-717-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It gives me a moment to gather my thoughts.","I feel steadier when I know my examples are organised.","The familiar steps help me focus on what I can control.","It feels like putting on armour and helps me feel ready."],"options":["It gives me a moment to gather my thoughts.","I feel steadier when I know my examples are organised.","The familiar steps help me focus on what I can control.","It feels like putting on armour and helps me feel ready."]},"advanced-native-717-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The routine felt like putting on armour."],"options":["She has decided to avoid the discussion instead of preparing to engage.","The routine felt like putting on armour.","She is rehearsing how to attack the other side’s position rather than steadying herself."]},"advanced-native-717-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The person can no longer be upset and should reject all support."],"options":["A person may feel more prepared for a difficult interaction.","A familiar routine may give someone a sense of protection.","The person can no longer be upset and should reject all support."]},"advanced-native-717-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Putting on armour is only a metaphor for feeling prepared here; you can still listen respectfully and ask for help."],"options":["Yes. Feeling prepared means refusing to hear any other viewpoint.","Support is unnecessary as soon as the routine makes you feel stronger.","Putting on armour is only a metaphor for feeling prepared here; you can still listen respectfully and ask for help."]},"advanced-native-717-v1-final":{"