('advanced-native-719', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-719-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It influenced the emotional impression of the scene."],"options":["It influenced the emotional impression of the scene.","It served only as a neutral timing cue, without affecting the mood.","It guaranteed that all viewers had exactly the same reaction.","It supplied new factual information about the characters’ actions."]},"advanced-native-719-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["A familiar tune can bring associations for some viewers.","It can colour the way we feel about a scene.","It can suggest tension or relief without changing the dialogue.","The tempo may affect the pace the audience senses."],"options":["A familiar tune can bring associations for some viewers.","It can colour the way we feel about a scene.","It can suggest tension or relief without changing the dialogue.","The tempo may affect the pace the audience senses."]},"advanced-native-719-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The music colours the way we feel about the scene."],"options":["The music proves the scene has only one possible interpretation.","The music colours the way we feel about the scene.","The soundtrack reveals a new plot fact that was not present in the original footage."]},"advanced-native-719-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["One feature completely determines every person’s feelings."],"options":["Other features may also affect the response.","One feature completely determines every person’s feelings.","A detail can influence the emotional impression."]},"advanced-native-719-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The comments may colour the way you feel about it, even if the work itself has not changed."],"options":["Treat the negative comments as sufficient proof that the work is poor before examining it yourself.","Other people’s comments can never influence a personal impression.","The comments may colour the way you feel about it, even if the work itself has not changed."]},"a