('advanced-native-721', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-721-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It felt natural and familiar to wear."],"options":["It was simply the second costume bought that day.","It felt natural and familiar to wear.","It was being worn for the first time and felt awkward.","It was guaranteed never to wear out."]},"advanced-native-721-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It feels like a second skin and never distracts me from moving.","It is light enough for the room we use.","I am used to where the pockets are.","It is comfortable and easy to wash."],"options":["It feels like a second skin and never distracts me from moving.","It is light enough for the room we use.","I am used to where the pockets are.","It is comfortable and easy to wash."]},"advanced-native-721-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The outfit feels like a second skin."],"options":["The outfit feels unfamiliar and restricts every movement.","The outfit is only reserved for display and is never worn in practice.","The outfit feels like a second skin."]},"advanced-native-721-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A new stiff costume feels awkward and constantly draws the wearer’s attention."],"options":["A performer barely notices a well-fitting costume after regular use.","A familiar outfit feels natural and comfortable in movement.","A new stiff costume feels awkward and constantly draws the wearer’s attention."]},"advanced-native-721-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["No. Calling it a second skin describes comfort and familiarity, not how long the fabric will last."],"options":["Postpone repairing the worn seam because the jacket still feels familiar.","Treat the comfortable feel as evidence that the fabric will last through another long trip.","No. Calling it a second skin describes comfort and familiarity, not how long the fabric will last."]},"advanced-native-721-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["My practice top feels like a second skin after months of dancing in it.