('advanced-native-722', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-722-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It was decisive in winning support."],"options":["It was decisive in winning support.","It was noticed but had no effect on the decision.","It delayed the vote without producing any result.","It was rejected in favour of appearance alone."]},"advanced-native-722-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The trial results gave them confidence in the approach.","The clear evidence carried the day.","We showed how the plan would fit the available budget.","Our examples answered their main concern."],"options":["The trial results gave them confidence in the approach.","The clear evidence carried the day.","We showed how the plan would fit the available budget.","Our examples answered their main concern."]},"advanced-native-722-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The well-supported argument carried the day."],"options":["The well-supported argument carried the day.","The argument was never heard by the judges.","The argument had no influence on the result."]},"advanced-native-722-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A feature attracts some attention, but the decision is still pending and its influence is unknown."],"options":["A decisive argument wins enough support for the proposal to pass.","A feature attracts some attention, but the decision is still pending and its influence is unknown.","A tested practical benefit secures the final choice."]},"advanced-native-722-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Design may help, but it may not carry the day if the proposal fails to address the main need."],"options":["Design may help, but it may not carry the day if the proposal fails to address the main need.","A striking design guarantees that no evidence will be needed.","If the slides attract attention, the panel has already accepted the plan."]},"advanced-native-722-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The clear budget and trial results carried the day. They persuaded the group to